//! Golden tests of the small structures (desert pyramid, jungle temple, swamp hut, igloo, buried treasure, shipwreck, ocean ruin,
//! ruined portal, nether fossil) against the real vanilla classes (fixtures `tests/fixtures/scattered/<structure>.txt.gz`,
//! generated by `tests/oracle/ScatteredStructuresOracle.java`, command lines in `tests/fixtures/scattered/README.txt`): the
//! generated start (every piece's saved tag, or "no valid start") for many seeds/chunks, and `placeInChunk` of the start over the
//! synthetic terrain (blocks as a per-chunk digest, block entity NBT incl. loot tables, entities, scheduled ticks, heightmaps,
//! post-processing marks, region random).

